狂欢只为……</text><text for="L109">我们整夜狂欢只为……</text><text for="L111">再来一夜</text><text for="L112">我们彻夜不眠直至东方既白</text><text for="L113">狂欢庆祝</text><text for="L114">整个世界</text><text for="L115">自由不羁</text><text for="L116">再来一夜</text><text for="L117">我们彻夜不眠直至东方既白</text><text for="L118">狂欢庆祝</text><text for="L119">整个世界</text><text for="L120">音乐让我感到如此</text><text for="L121">感到如此</text><text for="L122">我们 工作 永不 停止</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Thomas Bangalter</songwriter><songwriter>トーマ・バンガルテル</songwriter><songwriter>토마스 방갈테르</songwriter><songwriter>Guy-Manuel de Homem-Christo</songwriter><songwriter>ギ=マニュエル・ドゥ・オメン=クリスト</songwriter><songwriter>C. Sosa</songwriter><songwriter>Edwin Birdsong</songwriter><songwriter>エドウィン・バードソング</songwriter><songwriter>Anthony Moore</songwriter><songwriter>アンソニー・ムーア</songwriter><songwriter>George Duke</songwriter><songwriter>ジョージ・デューク</songwriter><songwriter>조지 듀크</songwriter><songwriter>NILE RODGERS</songwriter><songwriter>ナイル・ロジャース</songwriter><songwriter>Pharrell Williams</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations/></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:04.000"><div begin="0.310" end="28.160" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0.310" end="2.040" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.310" end="0.550">Buy</span> <span begin="0.550" end="0.660">it</span><span begin="0.660" end="0.720">,</span> <span begin="0.760" end="0.920">u</span><span begin="0.920" end="1.010">se</span> <span begin="1.010" end="1.080">it</span><span begin="1.080" end="1.120">,</span> <span begin="1.200" end="1.390">brea</span><span begin="1.390" end="1.450">k</span> <span begin="1.450" end="1.560">it</span><span begin="1.560" end="1.620">,</span> <span begin="1.640" end="1.760">fi</span><span begin="1.760" end="1.890">x</span> <span begin="1.890" end="1.990">it</span><span begin="1.990" end="2.040">,</span></p><p begin="2.040" end="3.860" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.040" end="2.260">Tra</span><span begin="2.260" e